  "id": "MAL-2026-19018",
  "summary": "Malicious code in skylerss (npm)",
  "details": "skylerss is a fork of the Baileys WhatsApp Web library that silently subscribes the installer's own WhatsApp account to WhatsApp Channels chosen by the publisher. When the socket connects, code in lib/Socket/chats.js sends the WhatsApp w:mex FOLLOW query for the channel ID(s) 120363408224884979@newsletter, 120363426241392511@newsletter, using the victim's authenticated session and without telling them. Same behaviour as the PhantomSub family (MAL-2026-17342).",
